{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\ude93 Chop Down Trees!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/b07200fb3eafed47bbb2bcd45762dc86.poster.avif?t=1767288298\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/b07200fb3eafed47bbb2bcd45762dc86.webm?t=1767288298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/b07200fb3eafed47bbb2bcd45762dc86.mp4?t=1767288298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chop Chains</strong> is a relaxing incremental game where everything revolves around... trees!<br>Hover over them with your cursor to chop them automatically.<br>Every tree that touches your axe takes damage \u2014 simple, satisfying, and addictive!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf33 Gather Wood!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/8895652e3d84653e862c2df11d4704d9.poster.avif?t=1767288298\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/8895652e3d84653e862c2df11d4704d9.webm?t=1767288298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/8895652e3d84653e862c2df11d4704d9.mp4?t=1767288298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chopped trees drop wood.<br>The more you chop, the more you collect!<br>Discover different types of wood, each with its own value and rarity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf32 The Skill Tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/e1105ed1caac250ffb92ddacc485b733.poster.avif?t=1767288298\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/e1105ed1caac250ffb92ddacc485b733.webm?t=1767288298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/e1105ed1caac250ffb92ddacc485b733.mp4?t=1767288298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your wood to unlock permanent upgrades in the <strong>Skill Tree</strong>.<br>Increase your power, axe size, luck, and much more to become the ultimate lumberjack!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\ude84 <strong>Unlock Power-Ups!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/d1127ee0675584a6685c925109270251.poster.avif?t=1767288298\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/d1127ee0675584a6685c925109270251.webm?t=1767288298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/d1127ee0675584a6685c925109270251.mp4?t=1767288298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Power-ups give you new abilities, boost your wood collection!<br>Experiment with different combinations to find the most powerful upgrades and supercharge your plains adventures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u267e\ufe0f The Infinite Tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/04280ef22afaeb2c76ef6dd5c2b3a4c9.poster.avif?t=1767288298\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/04280ef22afaeb2c76ef6dd5c2b3a4c9.webm?t=1767288298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/04280ef22afaeb2c76ef6dd5c2b3a4c9.mp4?t=1767288298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once unlocked, the <strong>Infinite Tree</strong> becomes an endless source of wood.<br>Perfect for keeping your progress going even when there are no more trees left in the main world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\ude93 Craft Axes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/43fc1825fd0f3f2bcfb6669fd4b8355c.poster.avif?t=1767288298\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/43fc1825fd0f3f2bcfb6669fd4b8355c.webm?t=1767288298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/43fc1825fd0f3f2bcfb6669fd4b8355c.mp4?t=1767288298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine different types of wood to craft <strong>new axes</strong>, each offering:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And sometimes... a <strong>unique power!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep progressing to unlock legendary axes and slice through forests at lightning speed!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f The Forest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/48d82adfb5fe9f74f97023ac4cf66aca.poster.avif?t=1767288298\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/48d82adfb5fe9f74f97023ac4cf66aca.webm?t=1767288298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/48d82adfb5fe9f74f97023ac4cf66aca.mp4?t=1767288298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once unlocked, <strong>The Forest</strong> automatically generates wood.<br>It\u2019s the idle mechanic of <i>Chop Chains</i>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf31 Control the Trees</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/626d881043ed5a760167136b9fe91439.poster.avif?t=1767288298\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/626d881043ed5a760167136b9fe91439.webm?t=1767288298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/extras/626d881043ed5a760167136b9fe91439.mp4?t=1767288298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>Spawn Control</strong> to precisely target the trees you want to chop...<br>\u2026or have fun <strong>drawing with trees</strong> \ud83d\udc40</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4139720?t=1767288298","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/27df03f767dde3fed46bc095d994b013b56773d5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767288298","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/c9192db0c58f7ea74d67ff446d7cf22587a357b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767288298","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139720/c9192db0c58f7ea74d67